# Cost of Brilliance: "Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life. Put
# a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature." The counter link's own
# targets (TargetMin$ 0 | TargetMax$ 1) are chosen as the spell is cast
# (CR 601.2c), after the player's; choosing none puts no counter, and the
# draw and life loss still happen.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 5 B
tapformana ai 6 B
tapformana ai 7 B
queue targets human
queue targets none
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
